out.push(A('⚠ **Every student reads their own first paragraph aloud, stopping at every verb, and the room says for each one whether it has a winner in it.** **In this class the first paragraphs have lost between one and four verbs and the commonest word struck has been _accepted_.** **Then Mr Tayara\'s sentence** — **and note that he caught it himself, which is the argument for a mechanical check over good intentions.**'));

